Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hi, All.

Hope you have a fun and safe Halloween evening!

According to the Apache Spark versioning policy, `branch-4.1` will be
created on November 1st as a way of soft feature freeze and a ramping down
stage in order to stabilize new features.

https://spark.apache.org/versioning-policy.html

Note that it's a soft feature freeze. The Apache Spark PMC member can
backport features from `master` to `branch-4.1` until November 15th.

Lastly, Apache Spark 4.1.0-preview3 is provided to you to help your
community evaluation, please try to use 4.1.0-preview3 and report us any
issues.

Thank you,
Dongjoon Hyun.

--00000000000068ffc90642766ae9
Content-Type: text/html; charset="UTF-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

